  Kimari, J., Djurabekova, F., & Sarakinos, K. (2026). A Self-Evolving Machine-Learning-Based
  Kinetic Monte Carlo Method for Modelling Thin-Film Growth. https://doi.org/10.48550/arXiv.2605.31144
